# T21 spot check B15 (missed-checkpoint notice), second try: Quick Race on Maple Street (run with
# --unlock-all). The racing line runs in the north half of the street; the car swerves into the
# south lane and drives east past CP2 (roundabout entry) ~20 u off the centreline, outside the
# gate → "Missed checkpoint — go back". Two attempts (Restart between). Gamepad for analog steering.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Aisle Rush
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Wrench Works
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Maple Street
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer 0.6
@45 hold gamepad steer -0.3
@75 hold gamepad steer 0
@120 shot m15_a_02s
@180 shot m15_a_03s
@240 shot m15_a_04s
@270 shot m15_a_045
@300 shot m15_a_05s
@330 shot m15_a_055
@360 shot m15_a_06s
@390 shot m15_a_065
@420 shot m15_a_07s
@450 shot m15_a_075
@480 shot m15_a_08s
@540 shot m15_a_09s
@600 shot m15_a_10s
release gamepad
0.2 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer 1
@30 hold gamepad steer -0.5
@60 hold gamepad steer 0
@180 shot m15_b_03s
@240 shot m15_b_04s
@300 shot m15_b_05s
@330 shot m15_b_055
@360 shot m15_b_06s
@390 shot m15_b_065
@420 shot m15_b_07s
@450 shot m15_b_075
@480 shot m15_b_08s
@540 shot m15_b_09s
@600 shot m15_b_10s
release gamepad
1.0 exit
